<title>HUNGARY: Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,503.73 points.</title>
<headline>Hungary's BUX ends officially at 7,503.73 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The BUX index of the Budapest Stock Exchange finished officially at a new closing high of 7,503.73 points, up 64.64 points or 0.87 percent, unchanged from the preliminary figures.</p>
<p>Spot share turnover totalled 5.0 billion forints, up from 4.752 billion on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
